@Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress = https://localhost:7244
# GUID value for the server group identifier
@RedisServerGroupId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@ContinuationToken = replace-with-token-from-previous-response
@BearerToken = replace-with-valid-bearer-token

### Authentication Bootstrap (anonymous)
GET {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/bootstrap

###

GET {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis-server-groups

###

### 401 Unauthorized — no token (expect 401)
GET {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis-server-groups

###

### 403 Forbidden — authenticated but wrong role (expect 403 with JSON body)
GET {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis-server-groups
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

###

### 200 OK — Reader policy: authenticated with reader role
GET {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis-server-groups
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

###

### 200 OK — Editor policy: authenticated with editor role
DELETE {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis-keys/test:string?groupId={{RedisServerGroupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

###

### 403 Forbidden — reader-only user attempts mutation (expect 403)
DELETE {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis-keys/test:string?groupId={{RedisServerGroupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{BearerToken}}

###

GET {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis-server-groups/{{RedisServerGroupId}}

### Redis INFO
GET {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/commands/redis-info?groupId={{RedisServerGroupId}}&host=localhost&port=6379

###

### Redis Key Search — bad request (invalid groupId)
GET {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis-keys?groupId=not-a-guid

###

### Redis Key Search — all keys (standalone)
GET {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis-keys?groupId={{RedisServerGroupId}}&pattern=*&pageSize=100

###

### Redis Key Search — unsupported Accept header
GET {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis-keys?groupId={{RedisServerGroupId}}
Accept: application/xml

###

### Redis Key Search — pattern filter (standalone)
GET {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis-keys?groupId={{RedisServerGroupId}}&pattern=session:*&pageSize=50

###

### Redis Key Search — oversized page size (server applies max page cap)
GET {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis-keys?groupId={{RedisServerGroupId}}&pattern=*&pageSize=5000

###

### Redis Key Search — verify enriched item attributes (type, ttlMilliseconds, hasExpiration)
GET {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis-keys?groupId={{RedisServerGroupId}}&pattern=test:*&pageSize=25

###

### Redis Key Search — cluster across masters (no host/port needed)
GET {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis-keys?groupId={{RedisServerGroupId}}&pattern=*&pageSize=100

###

###

### Redis Key Search — continuation with continuationToken from a previous response
GET {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis-keys?groupId={{RedisServerGroupId}}&pattern=*&continuationToken={{ContinuationToken}}&pageSize=100

###

### --- PHASE 1: String + Key Operations ---

### Set a string value
POST {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis/data/strings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "groupId": "{{RedisServerGroupId}}", "key": "test:string", "value": "hello world" }

###

### Set a string value with TTL (30 seconds)
POST {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis/data/strings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "groupId": "{{RedisServerGroupId}}", "key": "test:string:ttl", "value": "expires soon", "ttl": "00:00:30" }

###

### Set a string value with NX condition (only if not exists — should return success: false if key exists)
POST {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis/data/strings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "groupId": "{{RedisServerGroupId}}", "key": "test:string", "value": "should not overwrite", "condition": "NotExists" }

###

### Get a string value
GET {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis/data/strings?groupId={{RedisServerGroupId}}&key=test:string

###

### Get key metadata (type + TTL)
GET {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis-keys/test:string/metadata?groupId={{RedisServerGroupId}}

###

### Get key value (auto-detect type)
GET {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis-keys/test:string/value?groupId={{RedisServerGroupId}}

###

### Delete a key
DELETE {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis-keys/test:string?groupId={{RedisServerGroupId}}

###

### Delete non-existent key (should return deleted: false)
DELETE {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis-keys/test:string?groupId={{RedisServerGroupId}}

###

### --- PHASE 2: List + Set ---

### Push to list (right-push)
POST {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis/data/lists
Content-Type: application/json

{ "groupId": "{{RedisServerGroupId}}", "key": "test:list", "values": ["a", "b", "c"], "direction": "Right" }

###

### Push to list (left-push)
POST {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis/data/lists
Content-Type: application/json

{ "groupId": "{{RedisServerGroupId}}", "key": "test:list", "values": ["z"], "direction": "Left" }

###

### Get list range (all elements)
GET {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis/data/lists?groupId={{RedisServerGroupId}}&key=test:list&start=0&stop=-1

###

### Remove element from list (count=0 removes all occurrences)
POST {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis/data/lists/remove
Content-Type: application/json

{ "groupId": "{{RedisServerGroupId}}", "key": "test:list", "value": "b", "count": 1 }

###

### Add members to set
POST {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis/data/sets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "groupId": "{{RedisServerGroupId}}", "key": "test:set", "members": ["x", "y", "z"] }

###

### Get set members (cursor-based scan)
GET {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis/data/sets?groupId={{RedisServerGroupId}}&key=test:set&cursor=0&pageSize=100

###

### Remove members from set
POST {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis/data/sets/remove
Content-Type: application/json

{ "groupId": "{{RedisServerGroupId}}", "key": "test:set", "members": ["y"] }

###

### --- PHASE 3: Hash + Sorted Set ---

### Set hash fields
POST {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis/data/hashes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "groupId": "{{RedisServerGroupId}}", "key": "test:hash", "fields": { "name": "Alice", "age": "30", "city": "Warsaw" } }

###

### Set hash fields with TTL
POST {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis/data/hashes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "groupId": "{{RedisServerGroupId}}", "key": "test:hash:ttl", "fields": { "name": "Bob" }, "ttl": "00:05:00" }

###

### Get hash fields (cursor scan)
GET {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis/data/hashes?groupId={{RedisServerGroupId}}&key=test:hash&cursor=0&pageSize=100

###

### Remove hash fields
POST {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis/data/hashes/remove
Content-Type: application/json

{ "groupId": "{{RedisServerGroupId}}", "key": "test:hash", "fields": ["city"] }

###

### Add members to sorted set
POST {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis/data/sorted-sets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "groupId": "{{RedisServerGroupId}}", "key": "test:zset", "entries": [{ "member": "alpha", "score": 1.0 }, { "member": "beta", "score": 2.5 }, { "member": "gamma", "score": 3.0 }] }

###

### Add sorted set members with TTL
POST {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis/data/sorted-sets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "groupId": "{{RedisServerGroupId}}", "key": "test:zset:ttl", "entries": [{ "member": "a", "score": 1.0 }], "ttl": "00:10:00" }

###

### Get sorted set range (all elements by rank)
GET {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis/data/sorted-sets?groupId={{RedisServerGroupId}}&key=test:zset&start=0&stop=-1

###

### Remove members from sorted set
POST {{Roman.RedisManager.Web_HostAddress}}/api/redis/data/sorted-sets/remove
Content-Type: application/json

{ "groupId": "{{RedisServerGroupId}}", "key": "test:zset", "members": ["beta"] }

###
